# Derived data, rebuilt from the world log by datasets/merrick/build_tasks.py.
#
# Both shipped datasets ignore these two directories per task; merrick had
# no such file, and 451 files of a *partial* materialization were committed
# by accident -- inside the very commit that was undoing an earlier
# accidental commit of probe values. They read as this task's workspace and
# were 29% of a corpus that no longer exists.
#
# `tests/oracle.json` is deliberately NOT here: the answer key ships, and
# `tests/oracle.world` ships beside it so the next build can tell a solver
# regression from a later recording.
bundle/
environment/
__pycache__/
